37867>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
37867>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37868>>>                Case Break
37869>>>
37869>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37869>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37869>>>
37869>>>        Case End
37869>>>
37869>>>    End_Procedure
37870>>>
37870>>>
37870>>>End_Object 
